#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "معلومات حول التسجيل في IBM Quantum على IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime"
msgstr "التسجيل في Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "التسجيل في Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate platform logs that"
" you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your "
"account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr ""
"تُولّد خدمات IBM Cloud&reg;، كـ Qiskit Runtime، سجلات منصة يمكنك استخدامها "
"للتحقيق في النشاط غير الاعتيادي والإجراءات الحرجة في حسابك، وكذلك لاستكشاف "
"الأخطاء وإصلاحها.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-"
"router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route "
"platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring"
" a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, "
"see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-"
"router-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"يمكنك استخدام [IBM Cloud Logs Routing،](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-"
"router?topic=logs-router-about) وهي خدمة منصة، لتوجيه سجلات المنصة في حسابك "
"إلى وجهة تختارها عبر إعداد مستأجر يحدد أين تُرسَل هذه السجلات. لمزيد من "
"المعلومات، اطّلع على [About Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-"
"router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to "
"visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and "
"routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"يمكنك استخدام [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) لعرض "
"سجلات المنصة التي تُولَّد في حسابك بصريًا والتنبيه إليها، بعد توجيهها بواسطة"
" IBM Cloud Logs Routing إلى نسخة IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-"
"are-generated}"
msgstr ""
"المواقع التي تُولَّد فيها سجلات المنصة {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-"
"generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in "
"your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the "
"automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr ""
"يُولّد IBM Cloud Container Registry سجلات منصة تظهر في نسخ التسجيل لديك. "
"يسرد الجدول التالي المواقع التي تم فيها تفعيل جمع سجلات خدمة Container "
"Registry تلقائيًا.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| الموقع                      | هل سجلات خدمات المنصة متاحة؟ |\n"
"|-----------------------------|-------------------------------|\n"
"| واشنطن العاصمة (us-east)    |              نعم              |\n"
"| فرانكفورت (eu-de)           |              نعم              |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "سجلات المنصة التي تُولَّد {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Qiskit Runtime generates platform services logs that are displayed in "
"your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr ""
"يُولّد IBM Qiskit Runtime سجلات خدمات منصة تظهر في نسخ التسجيل لديك في "
"الحالات التالية:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "عند تغيُّر حالة مهمة (job).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-"
"observability-page}"
msgstr ""
"عرض السجلات من صفحة Observability {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-"
"page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see "
"**Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs "
"documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-"
"instance-launch).\n"
msgstr ""
"للاطلاع على كيفية تشغيل واجهة IBM Cloud Logs، راجع قسم **Launching the UI** "
"في [توثيق IBM Cloud Logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-"
"logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "الحقول حسب نوع السجل {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields "
"that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-"
"router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr ""
"للاطلاع على معلومات الحقول المضمَّنة في كل سجل منصة، راجع [Fields that are "
"included in platform logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-"
"router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "يشمل سجل السجلات الحقول التالية.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| الحقل           | النوع    | الوصف                                                                          |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | مطلوب    | يحدد الحساب ونسخة سجل التدفق التي نُشر فيها السجل.                            |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | مطلوب    | يحدد ما إذا كانت IBM تحفظ نسخة من السجل لأغراض تشغيلية.                       |\n"
"| message         | مطلوب    | وصف السجل الذي تم توليده.                                                      |\n"
